sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    critical Phase 1 (Current Year)
        participant Modeler as Modeler / Analyst
        participant FE as Sim-Engine Frontend
        participant BE as Sim-Engine Backend
        participant ORCH as Snapshot Orchestrator
        participant CE as Calculation Engine
        participant ODB as Operational DB
        participant SDB as Snapshot DB

        Modeler->>FE: Browser / HTTPS
        FE->>BE: HTTPS / REST
        BE->>ORCH: Job command (gRPC + Kafka topic)
        ORCH->>CE: gRPC streaming job contract
        CE->>ODB: JDBC / SQL streaming (fetch 1M rows × 50 cols)
        ODB-->>CE: Chunked SQL result stream
        CE->>SDB: Bulk insert snapshot dataset
        CE-->>ORCH: Job completion (status, checksum)
        ORCH-->>BE: Event callback (SnapshotReady)
        BE-->>FE: WebSocket / SSE job status update
        Modeler-->>SDB: SQL / BI query (read snapshot)
        BE->>SDB: JDBC read replica (serve UI/export)
    end

    critical Phase 2 (Future Scope)
        participant KQ as Kafkaesque Queue
        participant P2DB as Phase-2 Target DB

        BE->>KQ: Kafka (Avro/Proto) publish snapshot pointer
        KQ-->>P2DB: Kafka Connect / Sink persist snapshot
    end

